{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>They shall set out first.</b> When they see the cloud withdrawing, the priests sound the trumpets, and the camp of Judah sets out first. And when they march, they march in the order of their encampment — the Levites and the wagons in the middle, the standard of Judah to the east, of Reuben to the south, of Ephraim to the west, and of Dan to the north."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:09.223501503Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}